<title>FINLAND: Lipponen repeats Finland meets EMU criteria.</title>
<headline>Lipponen repeats Finland meets EMU criteria.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prime Minister Paavo Lipponen on Tuesday repeated that Finland meets all criteria for membership of the third stage of European economic and monetary union (EMU), and did so already last year.</p>
<p>&quot;On the whole, Finland meets all EMU requirements,&quot; Lipponen told reporters. &quot;Finland already last year met all the criteria,&quot; he said.</p>
</text>
